<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BAESA cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BAESA cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it cut its near-term rating on Buenos Aires Embotelladora SA to near-term sell from reduce and to long-term sell from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1/2 at 4-1/2 on the NYSE.</p>
</text>
